tests=[]
def t(k,comp,role,inp,metric,ready,gate):tests.append((f'T{len(tests)+1:02}',k,comp,role,inp,metric,ready,gate,lookup[k]))
t('KOH05','Uptake','Existing fit / internal check','Train small saturated fixed-time endpoint only; lock large cup geometry.','Predicted 20-min volume, cm³; signed error; water-mass balance.','Existing baseline frozen','Do not fit an additional membrane + soil resistance to the same single observation.')
t('LEU03','Field uptake','Prior and internal temporal check','Group by species; reserve 9 Sep in original stand.','Absolute conductivity error, m/(Pa s), compared to reported SD.','Existing baseline frozen','Not a site-independent validation.')
t('RUD94','Spruce radial uptake','Cross-study transfer diagnostic','Use hydrostatic root-area value, not osmotic. Do not re-fit LEU03.','Predicted / reported Lp; state age, tissue and external resistance.','Numerical target available','Field effective uptake vs seedlings/rinsed roots: an apparent mismatch is not a numerical error.')
t('HUE22','Glass wetting','Existing fit / within-run check','First two sites set wall input; keep two same-run sites unused.','Angle residual in degrees at held-out sites at each mesh.','Existing baseline frozen','Recalibrate numerical input when interface width or spacing changes.')
t('LIA26','Bridge mechanics','Independent component holdout','Fix angle, liquid volume and geometry independently; select whole Fig. 11 measured series by material/gap.','Absolute force error vs gap; measured footprint; rupture and measurement scatter.','Supplement required','No fitted forces; compare total force only after finite axial span and ends are accounted for.')
t('BUL20','DVC measurement','Instrument / method verification','Use repeat unloaded scans and known rigid motion; preselect subset size away from moving interfaces.','Displacement bias, RMS and upper noise percentile in mm; valid fraction.','Noise archive listed','Synthetic subvoxel error is not the physical noise floor.')
t('KEY17','Root growth DVC','Future growth holdout','Prescribe measured tip motion; use independent material/parameter tests. Keep second specimen untouched, not a different time frame of the first.','Axial and outward displacement / tip advance vs distance / root radius; valid fraction and uncertainty.','Raw greyscale pair required','Match time, register stationary frame, mask root and container at both times. Not a test of suction or growth rate if advance imposed.')
t('IIJ03','Penetration','Future independent growth holdout','Freeze tip geometry/tribology on other experiments; match Mephisto, density, moisture, 3–6 mm depth.','Measured force in mN and derived MPa; intact/decapped contrast with SE.','Numerical target available','Compare 3D force to N, not a 2D per-length force. Do not double-weight force and derived stress.')
t('ANS21','Soil rearrangement','Future sand holdout','Compare loose fine and coarse separately; keep soil preparation and scan pair.','Radius of above-bulk porosity in mm; porosity profiles.','Published summaries; volumes not ingested','Do not treat porosity radius as DVC displacement or read dense values from loose-sand data.')
t('BUL22','Many-grain direct shear','Future independent mechanics holdout','Tune dry mechanics elsewhere. Use Fallow P as unrooted comparison to Willow C, reserve Willow C responses.','Shear load/area and ux(z) at matched box displacement; filter DVC valid flag; inspect shear band.','Specimen states available; load/DVC files needed','Different soil states, no root growth and no pore-scale suction field. BUL20 and BUL22 Willow C are one sample.')
t('TOM21','Root pull-out / interface','Future controlled-suction holdout','Calibrate dry interface separately; reserve full wet suction series.','Peak/residual interfacial stress and slip at peak for each suction.','Suction settings entered; response curves not ingested','Imposed suction by itself is not a calibration observation.')
t('KAM14','Whole-root anchorage','Future system holdout','Match root geometry, scale, confining state and water-conditioning history.','Force–displacement curves in consistent scale and units; peak, displacement, work.','Reference only','Local bridge attraction cannot be validated directly by whole-root pull-out.')
t('CUN18','Root-wall recession','New experiment needed','Measure advancing/receding separately on matched intact root or porous surrogate; include replicates.','Receding angle with CI, contact line vs time, wetted span.','Open measurement gap','Cuneo measured advancing bark angle, not a replacement measurement.')
t('LIA26','Drainage-route hypothesis','New paired experiment needed','Same specimen geometry, same extracted volume history and actual gap; compare root uptake vs far-field drainage.','Paired force difference vs gap, local suction and wetted length; uncertainty on difference.','Direct data not identified','Set practical detection floor before testing. No fitted cohesion. Repeated points from one bridge are not replicates.')
t('ROS25','Growth / strain','Independent study-level holdout','Condition separately on sand/loam, root diameter, and genotype.','Radial displacement and strain profiles; contrast localisation by substrate.','Paper trends; source data on request','Avoid treating bulk translation as local deformation; compare at equivalent spatial smoothing.')
